            <ArticleTitle>[Antisoporific and cardiotropic properties of new amino acid derivatives of nicotinic acid].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>35-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>On the models of urethane, nembutal and ethyl alcohol sleep it was shown that nicotinoylcapronate, nicotinoylserine and nicotinoylvaline possess antihypnotic properties being superior to those of cordiamine and on some models phenamine. Nicotinoylvaline and nicotinoylalanine normalized the myocardial contraction in animals with experimental ischemia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
